              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Big Al"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This worked great! I always have trouble with pork that comes out dry. This pork was juicy and the peach tea and sauerkraut gave it a sweet and sour flavor. I drained the sauerkraut a bit but not all the way. One suggestion, make sure the pork roast does not have too much marbling of fat thru it. Trim it up before you put it in the crock pot.",
